    <contentRows>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "dd183f78-7d69-4eda-9b4c-a25970583a28",
      "key": "4eab56e3-1b51-4b76-941a-47b0f82d7965",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "content",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EDrops a public-facing, AI-powered chat widget on a website\u0026#39;s frontend. End users on the public site type a question; the package runs a semantic search over the site\u0026#39;s Umbraco content (Umbraco.AI.Search), feeds the matched pages into an Umbraco.AI.Agent, and streams a grounded answer back with cited source pages and follow-up suggestions.\n\nThe official Umbraco.AI.* packages expose chat only inside the backoffice. There is no path for an anonymous site visitor to ask questions of the site\u0026#39;s content. This community package fills that gap.\n\nKey features:\n- Public-facing widget (drop in one \u0026lt;script\u0026gt; tag)\n- Grounded answers with cited source pages\n- Suggested follow-up questions\n- Streaming responses (SSE)\n- Per-IP rate limiting and request size caps\n- Per-instance configuration in the backoffice (welcome message, agent, fallback)\n\nRequires Umbraco CMS 17.3\u002B, Umbraco.AI 1.10\u002B, Umbraco.AI.Agent 1.9\u002B, and a populated Umbraco.AI.Search index.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/umbraco.community.ai.chatbot\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
